</entity00159102:FootnotesOnAdjustedProfitLossNetOrRegulatoryReserve>
  <entity00159102:FootnotesOnAdjustedProfitLossNetOrRegulatoryReserveConsolidated contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">당기순이익은 신종자본증권 배당 차감 후 금액입니다.</entity00159102:FootnotesOnAdjustedProfitLossNetOrRegulatoryReserveConsolidated>
